  "sourceAuthoringNotes": [
    "R1 partial source stage is preserved after its authoring script encountered an LF/CRLF boundary assumption. R2 source author handles both endings.",
    "A missing work-stage parent directory was created before rerunning the author. Neither source-authoring failure executed a candidate.",
    "The initial unfrozen R2 save catch was strengthened to retain ownership after accepting a committed note while its list refresh is pending.",
    "R3 preserves frozen R2 and applies the parent-requested plain due-date copy in this future client only; six explicit pinned original URLs are added to the source contract. No text-only test or active copy was made.",
    "R4 corrects independently found late post-commit list-refresh publication ownership and adds one meaningful held/rejected-refresh UI group. All current active sources and prior frozen stages remain untouched."
